model the use of such concepts in a variety of contexts. Providing learners with concrete examples that 


clearly illustrate the meaning of concepts is an important feature of the tutorial, particularly given student 


difficulties with the abstract nature of statistical concepts. Learners have access to a flowchart or "map" 


illustrating the concepts that will be taught in the tutorial and how these are linked to the processes of data 


collection, data analysis, and data representation (i.e., data and graphs), which are also emphasized in the 


