F1. 
The program should start where the student is, not at the level of the instructor (I1). 


The program should accommodate students' conceptual development in a domain, common 


misconceptions that occur, and the knowledge that students typically bring to the classroom. 


F2. 
The program should promote learning as a constructive process in which the task is to provide 


